clj-shelley
===========

An independent Clojure implementation of the Shelley coding agent, written by
porting the behaviour of https://github.com/boldsoftware/shelley.

The code in src/, test/, resources/ui/ and resources/index.html is original.

Two parts are derived from the upstream project, which is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 Bold Software, Inc.:

1. resources/skills/*/SKILL.md — the five built-in agent skills, vendored
   unchanged (see resources/skills/NOTICE.md).
2. The HTTP surface, database schema history, tool contracts and hooks
   protocol, which were written to match the upstream implementation so the
   two behave alike. No upstream source files were copied for these.

